[PrintTextModified Text:又过了一天。|#0201Adv20_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:日子平静地过去，<br>除了监牢的卫生环境不佳外，<br>没有发生什么麻烦事。|#0201Adv20_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……好，就祈祷一切都按照正规进行，平安无事吧）|#0201Adv20_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我从简陋的床上起身，<br>揉了揉眼睛。|#0201Adv20_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不知为何，我内心的不安感<br>　似乎在逐渐增强）|#0201Adv20_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（也许在这种地方过着平安无事的日子，<br>　反而才是异常……）|#0201Adv20_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希、希罗，早上好。|#0201Adv20_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:早上好。|#0201Adv20_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛似乎已经起床了，<br>我冷淡地回应了她。|#0201Adv20_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:回应别人的问候是一种礼貌，我才不得不回应。<br>所以我的压力之源，正是同室的艾玛。|#0201Adv20_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我这么想着，片刻后——|#0201Adv20_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; ＠夏目アンアン

[PrintTextModified Text:呜哇啊啊啊！！！！|#0201Adv20_Unknown001| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_20_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:听到这声尖叫，<br>我立刻从床上跳了下来。|#0201Adv20_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:！？这声音是！？|#0201Adv20_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:不，不知道！<br>我们之中有谁是这种音色吗……！|#0201Adv20_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:在我们中几乎没有发出过声音的少女，<br>那就只有——她了。|#0201Adv20_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:总之就在隔壁。|#0201Adv20_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我们跑向了<br>夏目安安和城崎诺亚的房间。|#0201Adv20_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
