@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:到达现场的有我、艾玛，<br>还有莲见蕾雅。|#0201Adv20_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来其他人<br>都已经不在地下层了。|#0201Adv20_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你也听到了吗！？|#0201Adv20_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然了……！|#0201Adv20_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看到眼前的景象，<br>我不禁瞪大了眼睛。|#0201Adv20_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:这是怎么回事……|#0201Adv20_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:——诺亚！！！！|#0201Adv20_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
