@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:我犹豫着是否该进入房间。<br>因为房间内被涂成了一片雪白。|#0201Adv20_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从墙壁到地板，一切都彻底被白色覆盖。|#0201Adv20_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:能在一夜之间做到这种程度，<br>毫无疑问只有诺亚的魔法能做到。|#0201Adv20_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是希罗～|#0201Adv20_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:快看快看～<br>这样就可以画很多画了吧？|#0201Adv20_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚一看到我，<br>就带着满脸天真笑容迎了上来。|#0201Adv20_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:不是和我约好，只能在画室里画画吗！<br>呃……这是不正确的！！|#0201Adv20_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，但是啊，这也没办法嘛？<br>因为晚上一直被关在这里，<br>实在忍不住了嘛。|#0201Adv20_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚像是在闹别扭般说道，<br>仿佛自己真有正当理由似的。|#0201Adv20_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这让我头疼不已。|#0201Adv20_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:"（果然……所谓的预备魔女<br>　都有些脱离常轨之处吗）|#0201Adv20_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ＠備考◆苦しそうに

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……|#0201Adv20_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:循声望去，<br>房间深处的床上有个蠕动的影子。|#0201Adv20_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Angle01/Option_Arms- SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Angle01/Option_Arms- SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是夏目安安。|#0201Adv20_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆苦しそうに

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊……哈啊……哈啊……|#0201Adv20_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:安安看起来很不舒服……！<br>可能是因为颜料的气味……|#0201Adv20_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……<br>说起来，刚才好像听到了什么声音……|#0201Adv20_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:她就在你旁边尖叫啊！为什么没注意到！<br>快点把房间恢复原状！|#0201Adv20_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……不要。|#0201Adv20_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是我一时热血上头，说得太严厉了，<br>诺亚的情绪完全低落了下来。|#0201Adv20_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在蕾雅和艾玛把安安搬出去，<br>房间变空之际——|#0201Adv20_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1,ArmL5 SubId:Middle

; カラースプレー噴出音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_15 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:留下脚印了，<br>要弄得更白才行～|#0201Adv20_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她竟然<br>又开始在室内喷洒颜料。|#0201Adv20_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle

; ＠備考◆キレる

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0201Adv20_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:55 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle
