; ＠備考◆抗議のニュアンス

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗！|#0201Adv20_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我不由得打了诺亚一巴掌。|#0201Adv20_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Cry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚呆呆地看着我，然后……<br>眼眶满溢泪水，随时都要哭出来似的。|#0201Adv20_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……最讨厌希罗了。|#0201Adv20_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆動揺

[PrintTextModified Text:讨厌就讨厌吧。<br>诺亚做了不正确的事，都是诺亚不好！|#0201Adv20_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你们两个冷静点！<br>总之现在先把安安<br>送到医务室去！|#0201Adv20_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:1
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我和诺亚各自气鼓鼓地转过身去。|#0201Adv20_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，必须先把身体不适的安安带走，<br>这是毋庸置疑的……|#0201Adv20_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:于是我们决定前往医务室。|#0201Adv20_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

