@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……幸好没什么大碍。<br>在这里休息一会应该就能稳定下来了。|#0201Adv20_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

; ＠備考◆安堵

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了……|#0201Adv20_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv20_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我稍微远离安安的床，<br>独自站在一旁。|#0201Adv20_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我对自己有些震惊。|#0201Adv20_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我发现自己<br>把监督诺亚当成了自己的职责。|#0201Adv20_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚对此产生了反抗，<br>而我也变得情绪化。|#0201Adv20_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我用手机向所有人告知了这次的事件，<br>然后深深地叹了口气。|#0201Adv20_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:那个，安安，<br>对不起……|#0201Adv20_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚似乎终于意识到事态的严重性，显得很懊悔。<br>她萎靡不振，紧贴在安安的床边。|#0201Adv20_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚不是故意的哦。<br>但是，就是忍不住想画画……|#0201Adv20_Noah009| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不是故意的，<br>也不行。|#0201Adv20_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果无法控制自己，<br>那就暂时禁止画画。|#0201Adv20_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不由自主地插嘴了。|#0201Adv20_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚顿时脸一皱，<br>瞪向我这边。|#0201Adv20_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不要！那不行！<br>诺亚会注意的！一定没问题的！|#0201Adv20_Noah010| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚不画画的话，<br>就要迷失自我了！|#0201Adv20_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:看着安安，你还能说出这种话吗！|#0201Adv20_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我语气严厉地<br>指着安安的病床。|#0201Adv20_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜呜呜……！|#0201Adv20_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:希、希罗！你冷静一点。<br>安安会被吵醒的哦。|#0201Adv20_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的制止让我感到屈辱。<br>我紧紧握住自己的一只手臂。|#0201Adv20_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚，已经在反省了……！<br>已经知道自己对安安做了不好的事情了……！<br>|#0201Adv20_Noah013| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚会照顾安安的！<br>会一直陪在她身边直到她康复！|#0201Adv20_Noah014| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你以为这样就能解决问题吗！？|#0201Adv20_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:那该怎么办嘛！？|#0201Adv20_Noah015| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经无法挽回了！<br>犯下的事实是无法改变的！|#0201Adv20_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:85 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR4
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR4
@Wait WaitMode:0.25
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:85 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅拍了拍我的肩膀。|#0201Adv20_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:85 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:……好了，希罗。<br>诺亚自告奋勇照顾病人，作为反省的表现来说，是件好事。|#0201Adv20_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所幸安安的情况也没那么糟糕。<br>能不能网开一面呢。|#0201Adv20_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:85 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:你们现在最好不要待在一起。<br>看样子双方都无法冷静下来……|#0201Adv20_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:85 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们出去透透气吧。<br>艾玛也一起来好吗？|#0201Adv20_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯。希罗我们走吧……？|#0201Adv20_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在两人的催促下，<br>我被带出了房间。|#0201Adv20_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

