[PrintTextModified Text:脑子里其实明白，<br>生气也于事无补。|#0201Adv20_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……是我的错。|#0201Adv20_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在离开房间的最后一刻，我轻声呢喃道。|#0201Adv20_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗责任感很强这一点，<br>我觉得很了不起哦。|#0201Adv20_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:而且……老实说我也有点生气。<br>多亏你代替我发火了，我才能冷静下来。|#0201Adv20_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅像是找到了同谋一样，<br>对我微笑着……|#0201Adv20_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我却无法回以笑容。|#0201Adv20_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

